{%- comment -%}
  Section: WLD — EquilibraMeno — Etapes texte + image (chaque etape a SA PROPRE image a cote de SON texte)
  A ajouter via Admin Shopify > Boutique en ligne > Themes > Modifier le code > Sections > Ajouter une nouvelle section.
  Pas de sticky : quand on scroll, on voit le texte de l'etape 1 avec l'image de l'etape 1, puis en dessous
  le texte de l'etape 2 avec l'image de l'etape 2, etc. Chaque "Etape" est un bloc avec : titre, texte
  (gras possible), image, et une image ronde optionnelle en superposition (pour un gif ou une photo zoomee).
  Sur mobile l'image passe au-dessus du texte.
{%- endcomment -%}

<div id="wld-eqm-sticky-{{ section.id }}" class="eqm-sticky">
  {%- if section.settings.title != blank -%}
    <h2 class="eqm-sticky__title">{{ section.settings.title }}</h2>
  {%- endif -%}

  {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
    {%- if block.type == 'step' -%}
      <div class="eqm-sticky__pair" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
        <div class="eqm-sticky__media-col">
          <div class="eqm-sticky__media-inner">
            {%- if block.settings.image -%}
              {{ block.settings.image | image_url: width: 900 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', class: 'eqm-sticky__image' }}
            {%- else -%}
              <div class="eqm-sticky__placeholder">Imagen etapa {{ forloop.index }}</div>
            {%- endif -%}
            {%- if block.settings.show_inset and block.settings.inset_image -%}
              <div class="eqm-sticky__inset">
                {{ block.settings.inset_image | image_url: width: 300 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', class: 'eqm-sticky__inset-image' }}
              </div>
            {%- endif -%}
          </div>
        </div>

        {%- unless block.settings.title == blank and block.settings.text == blank -%}
          <div class="eqm-sticky__text-col">
            {%- if block.settings.title != blank -%}
              <h3 class="eqm-sticky__step-title">{{ block.settings.title }}</h3>
            {%- endif -%}
            <div class="eqm-sticky__step-text">{{ block.settings.text }}</div>
          </div>
        {%- endunless -%}
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}
  {%- endfor -%}
</div>

<style>
  #wld-eqm-sticky-{{ section.id }} {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 56px 24px;
    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  #wld-eqm-sticky-{{ section.id }} * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  #wld-eqm-sticky-{{ section.id }} .eqm-sticky__title {
    font-weight: 700;
    font-style: italic;
    color: #5c1730;
    font-size: 24px;
    text-align: center;
    margin: 0 0 40px 0;
  }
  #wld-eqm-sticky-{{ section.id }} .eqm-sticky__pair {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 60px;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 40px 0;
    border-top: 2px solid #2b1620;
  }
  #wld-eqm-sticky-{{ section.id }} .eqm-sticky__pair:first-child {
    padding-top: 0;
    border-top: none;
  }
  #wld-eqm-sticky-{{ section.id }} .eqm-sticky__media-inner {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;
    border-radius: 18px;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: #fdf1f5;
  }
  #wld-eqm-sticky-{{ section.id }} .eqm-sticky__image {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
  }
  #wld-eqm-sticky-{{ section.id }} .eqm-sticky__placeholder {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    color: #b5302f;
    font-size: 13px;
    text-align: center;
    border: 2px dashed #f0b7ae;
  }
  #wld-eqm-sticky-{{ section.id }} .eqm-sticky__inset {
    position: absolute;
    right: 16px;
    bottom: 16px;
    width: 34%;
    aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;
    border-radius: 50%;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 4px solid #ffffff;
    box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.25);
  }
  #wld-eqm-sticky-{{ section.id }} .eqm-sticky__inset-image {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
  }
  #wld-eqm-sticky-{{ section.id }} .eqm-sticky__step-title {
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #2b1620;
    margin: 0 0 20px 0;
  }
  #wld-eqm-sticky-{{ section.id }} .eqm-sticky__step-text {
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: #3a3038;
  }
  #wld-eqm-sticky-{{ section.id }} .eqm-sticky__step-text p {
    margin: 0 0 16px 0;
  }
  #wld-eqm-sticky-{{ section.id }} .eqm-sticky__step-text strong {
    color: #5c1730;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    #wld-eqm-sticky-{{ section.id }} .eqm-sticky__pair {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 24px;
    }
    #wld-eqm-sticky-{{ section.id }} .eqm-sticky__media-col {
      order: -1;
    }
  }
</style>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "WLD Etapes texte + image",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "title",
      "label": "Titre au-dessus (optionnel)",
      "default": "+20.000 mujeres confían en nosotras"
    }
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "step",
      "name": "Etape",
      "settings": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "title",
          "label": "Titre de l'etape"
        },
        {
          "type": "richtext",
          "id": "text",
          "label": "Texte (gras possible via l'editeur)"
        },
        {
          "type": "image_picker",
          "id": "image",
          "label": "Image principale"
        },
        {
          "type": "checkbox",
          "id": "show_inset",
          "label": "Afficher une image ronde en superposition (gif/photo)",
          "default": false
        },
        {
          "type": "image_picker",
          "id": "inset_image",
          "label": "Image ronde en superposition (gif ou photo)"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "WLD Etapes texte + image",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "step",
          "settings": {
            "title": "🌿 Cómo actúa EquilibraMeno",
            "text": "<p><strong>+3 activos naturales clave:</strong></p><p><strong>Actea de racimo negro</strong>: ayuda a <strong>acompañar los cambios hormonales</strong>, especialmente en esta etapa, para evitar los desequilibrios que afectan al bienestar íntimo.</p><p><strong>Magnesio liposomal y vitamina B6</strong>: contribuyen al <strong>sistema nervioso</strong> y a un <strong>metabolismo hormonal normal</strong>.</p><p>Gracias a esta sinergia, EquilibraMeno favorece un <strong>entorno íntimo equilibrado</strong>, propicio a un <strong>pH estable</strong>, una <strong>flora sana</strong> y una <strong>sensación de confort íntimo</strong> duradera.</p>"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "settings": {
            "title": "La biología 🔬",
            "text": "<p>La vagina alberga un microbiota naturalmente rico, esencial para su equilibrio. Pero los <strong>desequilibrios hormonales</strong>, especialmente antes de la regla o durante un síndrome premenstrual marcado, pueden alterar este microbiota. Esto puede influir en el <strong>pH vaginal</strong> y favorecer la aparición de <strong>bacterias no deseadas</strong>, responsables de <strong>molestias</strong> y, en ocasiones, de <strong>olores desagradables</strong>.</p>"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "enabled_on": {
    "templates": ["product", "index", "page"]
  }
}
{% endschema %}